sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Client App
    participant ChatGW as Chat Gateway
    participant ChatCtrl as Chat Controller
    participant Prompt as Prompt Service
    participant LLM as LLM Service
    participant Ret as Retrieval Service
    participant MsgRepo as Message Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant PGV as pgvector

    User->>Client: Send chat text
    Client->>ChatGW: POST /chat
    ChatGW->>ChatCtrl: handleMessage()
    ChatCtrl->>Prompt: buildPrompt(session, turn, persona)
    Prompt-->>ChatCtrl: promptTemplate + vars

    ChatCtrl->>LLM: generate(prompt)
    par RAG retrieval
        LLM->>Ret: retrieveRelevantDocs(query)
        Ret->>PGV: similaritySearch(embeddings)
        PGV-->>Ret: topK passages
        Ret-->>LLM: context passages
    and Generation
        LLM-->>ChatCtrl: answer + citations
    end

    ChatCtrl->>MsgRepo: save user/assistant messages
    MsgRepo->>PG: INSERT messages
    ChatCtrl-->>ChatGW: response payload
    ChatGW-->>Client: assistant answer
